<!-- A large fort (T339), from the pilot fort of T337 (lab/banco/metodo/pilota/forte.xml): the composition at a quarter of the scale
     (A), the heights (B), the full scale (C). What changes: the courtyard grows with the box (its arms stop at random, not after a
     number of cells), barracks stand against the walls, and the detail at full scale runs a piece at a time: stairs, battlements,
     arrow slits look at most as far as a stair is long. -->
